# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_.

# Microsoft Clarity project ID — powers heatmaps and session replay.
# Get one free at https://clarity.microsoft.com (Settings → Overview).
# Leave empty and Clarity simply never loads; GA4 keeps working on its own.
VITE_CLARITY_ID=

# Note: the GA4 Measurement ID is not here. It is a public identifier that
# ships in the client bundle regardless, so it lives in src/lib/analytics/core.js.
